        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo wakandaambila kuti, Aya maanzi alatozya kucisi cakujwe, alaya ku-Araba, alanjila mulwizi. Anjila buyo mulwizi, maanzi aalula aakooko ayootontozegwa. ",
