        {
          "text": "Lino kufumbwa oko mulonga nkuusika, zintu zyuumi zyoonse ziyoovula ziyoopona, alimwi kuyooba inswi zinji loko, nkaambo aya maanzi asika kuti maanzi aamulwizi atontozegwe, aboobo zintu zyoonse ziyoopona kufumbwa oko mulonga nkuusika, ",
          "type": "text",
