        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela basikuzuba bayooima kulinguwo; kuzwa ku-Engedi akusikila ku-Eglaimu koonse koonse kuyooyanikwa insabwe; kuyooba inswi zyamisyobo minji loko mbubonya mbuli inswi zyakulwizi lupati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
