        {
          "text": "Alimwi ankomwe zyamulonga kumabazu conse obile, kuyoomena misamu yoonse iiligwa, Matu aayo takooyookunkumuka, amicelo yayo tiikooyookuba pe. Inooyoozyala micelo mipya myeezi yoonse, nkaambo kamaanzi aazwa kucikombelo aasika kulinjiyo. Micelo yayo inooyooligwa, amatu aayo anooyoosilisigwa.",
          "type": "text",
